{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "她应该马上出来澄清的  (She Should Have Stepped Out to Clarify)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the human-resources office, Bu Xiaogu wonders aloud why Xin Huimei hasn't refuted the marriage rumors—receiving a stern warning from HR not to cause any scandal for Chun Yuqiao—while Kaiwen helps Huimei slip past staking paparazzi. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，你说淳于总对我是不是真挺好的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你看八卦新闻了吗？按她的性格，她应该马上出来澄清的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但她并没有，之前我还以为是谣言。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天好多粉丝都相信是真的了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "她就是结婚了对吧，还是隐婚？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你说啊，我之前还以为她喜欢淳于总呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么现在的状况啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "惠美，车钥匙给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总让我来的，车钥匙给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他就在后门口等你，快去吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "车走了，把记者引开了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，让他们追我的车吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，你说淳于总对我是不是真挺好的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, wouldn't you say Mr Chun Yuqiao really treats me wonderfully?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你看八卦新闻了吗？按她的性格，她应该马上出来澄清的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you see the tabloid news? Knowing Xin Huimei's personality, she should have refuted it right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但她并没有，之前我还以为是谣言。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet she hasn't said a word — at first I assumed it was pure rumor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天好多粉丝都相信是真的了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today, lots of her own fans are starting to believe it's true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "她就是结婚了对吧，还是隐婚？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could she really have gotten married in secret?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你说啊，我之前还以为她喜欢淳于总呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Between us, before today I honestly thought she had feelings for Mr Chun Yuqiao!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么现在的状况啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — what current situation do you mean?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "惠美，车钥匙给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei, hand me your car keys.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总让我来的，车钥匙给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao sent me — give me the keys.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他就在后门口等你，快去吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is waiting for you right by the side entrance — hurry!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "车走了，把记者引开了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The car's rolling — luring the reporters away!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，让他们追我的车吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good, let them chase me down the street instead.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，你说淳于总对我是不是真挺好的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你看八卦新闻了吗？按她的性格，她应该马上出来澄清的。",
      "gap": 0.5
